      captionText: !<reference.Text> e59c4c81-01fc-4e60-8c8d-845fa394138e
      captions: !<string[]>
        - Take a breath
        - "You've entered a sacred space"
        - "Where the past, present and future meet"
        - Mother Nature needs our help
        - She asks us to remember
        - To reach back before we move forward
        - To listen to those who walked before
        - These fireflies are ancestors
        - And they are waiting for you
        - To call them forward
        - speak the word
        - 'speak the word "RISE"'
        - ""
        - They have returned
        - with their stories and their wisdom
        - The come bearing gifts
        - Remnants of their strength
        - their knowledge
        - and their love
        - to receive a gift
        - reach out and pinch it with your finger and thumb
        - What you carry now is sacred
        - Each token holds a seed of memory
        - worn around your wrist
        - To awaken their full power
        - We must all connect
        - Place your hand upon Mother Earth
        - And let them feel your love
        - They feel you
        - and remember you
        - You are their future
        - And they are your roots
        - Now
        - Watch as memory becomes power
        - As Many
        - Become One
        - This is the future born of the past
        - Wherever they step
        - New life grows
        - "Now, move your hands"
        - You too carry the seed
        - Wherever you go
        - let beauty follow
        - ""
